#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:7
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:9
msgid "You can find this feature under the \"Adobe\" category in the Key Library."
msgstr "この機能は、Key Library の「Adobe」カテゴリにあります。"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:11
msgid "![1743306772781](image/extendscript/1743306772781.png)"
msgstr "![1743306772781](image/extendscript/1743306772781.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:11
msgid "1743306772781"
msgstr "1743306772781"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:13
msgid ""
"Select the target Adobe application you want to run the script on, then edit"
" your script in the code editor below."
msgstr "スクリプトを実行する対象の Adobe アプリケーションを選択し、以下のコードエディターでスクリプトを編集します。"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:15
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/adobe/extendscript.md:17
msgid ""
"Once uploaded to the Flexbar, simply click the corresponding key to execute "
"the assigned ExtendScript."
msgstr "Flexbar にアップロードしたら、対応するキーをクリックするだけで、割り当てられた ExtendScript が実行されます。"
